# Credentials. Nothing in this tree holds one today — the Migma API key lives in the Spotify
# client's local storage under `migma:settings`, never on disk — but an ignore rule only helps
# if it is in place before the mistake, not after it.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx

# Editor and IDE state. Personal, not project configuration.
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# OS directory metadata.
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# Throwaway verification harnesses. The token, class, contrast and purity sweeps are written,
# run, and deleted in the same pass; an interrupted pass must not leave one in a commit.
_*.cjs

# Deliberately absent: no `node_modules/`, no `dist/`, no `build/`, no coverage or cache
# directories. There is no dependency manager and no build step — Spicetify loads these source
# files as they are — so a rule for any of them would be noise that hides the lines above.
